{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras/6fcd7b5f2af3ae7970e775f3752b57a5.avif?t=1768582827\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras_big/6fcd7b5f2af3ae7970e775f3752b57a5.webp?t=1768582827 width=1560 height=1480 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras/afe1ebac62b72f12005be0b04e45a1fb.poster.avif?t=1768582827\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras/afe1ebac62b72f12005be0b04e45a1fb.webm?t=1768582827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras/afe1ebac62b72f12005be0b04e45a1fb.mp4?t=1768582827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/extras/7a1ba56500877b7ba9421ef831195c36.avif?t=1768582827\" width=1560 height=1518 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Text-Only Version | For Screen Reader</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to D.I.C.E.!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight, you are invited to D.I.C.E., a game of Death, Intellect, Cruelty and Elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delightful dinner where dice are served as your final course, in our exquisite Art Deco establishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If luck is on your side, you may survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules of the Table</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in a tense 1v1 match, either against another player online or singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both of you are served 5 dice. The goal is simple: roll the best hand, using rules inspired by Poker with a few twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not lucky? Use Gambits to reroll, manipulate or even sabotage your opponent\u2019s plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep winning until only one remains seated at the dinner table.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's on the Table</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice</strong>: Each player rolls 5 dice to form hands based on modified Poker rules, including Flush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambits</strong>: Choose from over 8 different Gambits\u00a0to influence your dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Engage in online matches with friends or random players through matchmaking or private lobbies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer</strong>: Play against AI opponents of varying difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks</strong>: Progress and earn new cosmetic rewards by winning matches.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853970?t=1768582827","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853970?t=1768582827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/4cfe2bcd5449049fcac88ee6a70bc7c39e78d5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768582827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/4cfe2bcd5449049fcac88ee6a70bc7c39e78d5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768582827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Famil