he Table</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in a tense 1v1 match, either against another player online or singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both of you are served 5 dice. The goal is simple: roll the best hand, using rules inspired by Poker with a few twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not lucky? Use Gambits to reroll, manipulate or even sabotage your opponent\u2019s plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep winning until only one remains seated at the dinner table.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's on the Table</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice</strong>: Each player rolls 5 dice to form hands based on modified Poker rules, including Flush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambits</strong>: Choose from over 8 different Gambits\u00a0to influence your dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Engage in online matches with friends or random players through matchmaking or private lobbies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer</strong>: Play against AI opponents of varying difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks</strong>: Progress and earn new cosmetic rewards by winning matches.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Reija"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853970/455bff8728a8b18bd0d57cb3f90dd0989182b8a9/header.jpg?t=1768582827","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t